WEBVTT

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:54.387 --> 00:55.889
Throughout my life,

00:55.972 --> 00:58.433
I spent most of my time
on this tree alone.

00:59.642 --> 01:00.977
So I wonder what it was

01:01.061 --> 01:04.689
that made me wait
for someone to come for me.

01:05.231 --> 01:06.733
Because we made a promise.

01:07.567 --> 01:09.360
You may not have remembered me,

01:10.070 --> 01:12.238
but you remembered
our promise to be together,

01:12.947 --> 01:14.365
which is why you waited for me.

01:36.554 --> 01:38.723
I asked you to carry me last time,
but you just left.

01:46.439 --> 01:47.273
There.

01:47.982 --> 01:48.983
Are you happy?

01:52.487 --> 01:54.906
If this is a brief chance
to keep the promise we made,

01:55.949 --> 01:58.243
let us spend time together
like any other couple

01:58.326 --> 02:02.539
who have met after pining
and longing for each other.

02:09.504 --> 02:11.297
These chestnuts have already matured.

02:17.554 --> 02:19.556
- You are right.
- Shall we cook them in rice?

02:20.181 --> 02:21.141
Sure.

02:23.685 --> 02:26.688
Do you remember throwing things at me
when I was cooking last time?

02:28.273 --> 02:29.816
- I did?
- "I did"?

02:30.650 --> 02:32.235
You even threw a knife at me.

02:32.944 --> 02:34.404
- Like this?
- Do not do it.

02:34.487 --> 02:35.864
I bet I threw it like this.

02:51.254 --> 02:52.463
All right.

02:52.547 --> 02:55.800
I will pretend as if this is nothing more

02:55.884 --> 02:58.052
than just another ordinary day together

02:59.220 --> 03:02.056
and I will watch over you until the end.

03:05.935 --> 03:07.729
We should make chestnut rice

03:08.354 --> 03:10.398
since both you and Master Lee like it.

03:13.735 --> 03:14.819
Master Lee?

03:16.487 --> 03:18.656
He is currently at his hut in Danhyanggok.

03:18.740 --> 03:21.075
He was the one who brought me here.

03:36.841 --> 03:40.428
Did the Unanimous Assembly ask you
to take the ice stone out of Jang Uk?

03:40.511 --> 03:42.055
I told them I could not

03:42.931 --> 03:46.434
because there is another soul shifter
he has yet to catch.

03:48.519 --> 03:50.813
I see you have decided
to let him catch you.

03:54.776 --> 03:57.278
Then you should go to Danhyanggok.

03:58.238 --> 04:00.949
I am also responsible
for how things turned out for you two,

04:01.616 --> 04:04.494
and I cannot sit back
and do nothing like I did before.

04:04.577 --> 04:05.411
It is time

04:06.329 --> 04:07.830
that I do my part.

04:11.209 --> 04:14.295
What is it that you have to do with us?

04:16.089 --> 04:19.425
I did nothing when you were
a young master and a servant.

04:19.509 --> 04:22.762
I also did not interfere
when you were a master and a pupil.

04:23.846 --> 04:24.806
However,

04:24.889 --> 04:27.016
I cannot sit by and watch
as one must be hunted

04:27.100 --> 04:28.601
and the other must be the hunter.

04:29.185 --> 04:31.771
So I wish to put an end
to your current relationship.

04:33.815 --> 04:37.986
You saved my life,
so I will accept whatever choice you make.

04:38.069 --> 04:40.905
Then will you follow my decision
no matter what?

04:50.373 --> 04:51.666
Then I want you two…

04:57.422 --> 04:58.506
to have a wedding.

05:00.550 --> 05:02.260
I shall be your witness.

05:03.136 --> 05:04.595
I want you two to be officially married.

05:12.603 --> 05:13.479
Let us get ready.

05:14.314 --> 05:16.858
The weather is nice,
so let us get it done and over with.

05:16.941 --> 05:17.942
All right.

05:31.622 --> 05:32.665
Listen, you two.

05:33.750 --> 05:34.876
Is this a matriculation ceremony?

05:35.585 --> 05:37.462
Oh, do you wish to be my pupil?

05:38.212 --> 05:39.714
Will you drink chaste herb tea

05:39.797 --> 05:41.299
and practice chastity starting today?

05:41.382 --> 05:42.800
- No.
- No way.

05:43.593 --> 05:44.594
This is a wedding.

05:45.219 --> 05:46.596
You should be facing each other.

05:46.679 --> 05:48.556
Oh, right.

05:51.059 --> 05:53.728
A wedding ceremony
is how you announce your marriage

05:53.811 --> 05:55.730
to the people around you.

05:56.314 --> 05:58.191
But it is also to inform the skies.

05:58.775 --> 06:00.735
"We have decided to be together."

06:00.818 --> 06:03.905
"Therefore, no one can set us apart."

06:03.988 --> 06:05.281
That is what the message is.

06:07.533 --> 06:09.619
Now, Jang Uk of the Jang family and…

06:14.665 --> 06:15.583
Come to think of it,

06:16.375 --> 06:17.627
you have four names.

06:18.336 --> 06:22.340
You were born as Cho Yeong,
but you grew up as the assassin, Naksu.

06:22.423 --> 06:23.966
Then you lived as Mu-deok,

06:25.301 --> 06:26.677
and now you are Jin Bu-yeon.

06:28.679 --> 06:30.056
I never had a chance to live

06:30.973 --> 06:32.725
with just one name.

06:33.768 --> 06:35.478
Which name shall I call you by?

06:37.647 --> 06:39.982
The name that my parents gave me
when I was born.

06:43.111 --> 06:44.779
I would like to be called Cho Yeong.

06:49.492 --> 06:50.576
Uk and Yeong.

06:51.828 --> 06:53.663
Your name means "light."

06:53.746 --> 06:55.665
And your name means "shadow."

06:55.748 --> 06:57.625
Light and shadow.

06:59.961 --> 07:00.962
It may be that you two

07:02.213 --> 07:04.048
were fated to meet from the start.

07:05.091 --> 07:09.804
Let us now begin the wedding ceremony
of Jang Uk and Cho Yeong.

07:22.483 --> 07:23.401
It is a wedding drink.

07:35.872 --> 07:37.373
If you drink that,

07:37.457 --> 07:39.041
it means we are officially married.

07:41.127 --> 07:42.837
Go on. Drink up.

07:48.384 --> 07:51.220
If you turn this off,
I will take you with me.

07:52.847 --> 07:54.474
You and I…

07:55.600 --> 07:57.018
have liked each other for a long time.

08:01.063 --> 08:04.734
I shall always stay by your side
at this distance.

08:06.402 --> 08:07.612
That is my promise.

08:11.115 --> 08:12.241
I must be going crazy…

08:13.159 --> 08:14.368
because of you.

08:15.745 --> 08:17.622
I found another use for you.

08:18.206 --> 08:21.334
After all, you are offering
to substitute for her.

08:24.295 --> 08:25.963
But this is my hand that you are holding,

08:26.839 --> 08:30.259
and it will be me who holds you
and puts you to bed at night.

08:33.095 --> 08:37.141
So when you are looking at me,
see me for who I am.

08:40.019 --> 08:41.312
You look pretty.

08:42.939 --> 08:44.440
You told me to see you for who you were.

08:45.149 --> 08:47.235
That is what I am trying to do.

08:47.318 --> 08:48.319
I will also…

08:49.529 --> 08:54.617
boast to everyone that you lit up
a dark path for me late at night. 

08:55.618 --> 08:57.578
Sure, go ahead.

09:01.791 --> 09:04.418
I plan to find my own room.

09:05.336 --> 09:09.173
I will find out who I really am
and decorate my room with my own traits.

09:10.883 --> 09:11.801
I hope…

09:12.718 --> 09:14.679
that makes it easier for you to find me.

09:15.846 --> 09:19.016
I will keep you warm
and help you rest comfortably.

09:20.685 --> 09:21.852
I just pine for you.

09:22.812 --> 09:24.355
That is why I came to see you.

09:32.530 --> 09:34.198
I liked you from the start.

09:37.201 --> 09:38.536
I knew the moment I saw you.

09:39.537 --> 09:40.830
You are my husband.

09:43.541 --> 09:46.335
I now pronounce you husband and wife.

09:47.753 --> 09:50.131
You have informed the skies
through this ceremony,

09:50.214 --> 09:52.925
so I wish you a long life together.

09:56.304 --> 09:59.223
Among all the married couples
I have seen through my entire life,

10:00.266 --> 10:01.684
you two are the dearest.

10:22.663 --> 10:23.497
I promised you

10:24.707 --> 10:26.584
that I would bring you up here.

10:26.667 --> 10:28.794
You were right.
You can see the world from up here.

10:30.671 --> 10:31.714
It is nice.

10:38.763 --> 10:40.389
Now that I look at you like this,

10:42.642 --> 10:44.727
it feels as if it has been a long time
since we last met,

10:45.436 --> 10:47.355
but it also feels as if we met yesterday.

10:51.233 --> 10:52.568
It feels strange.

11:03.954 --> 11:06.791
It feels like I held your hand
a long time ago.

11:08.709 --> 11:11.337
But it also feels like I only
recently held it for the very first time.

11:16.634 --> 11:18.219
Everything is clear to me now.

11:18.302 --> 11:19.553
Deep down inside,

11:21.263 --> 11:22.932
I recognized you from the start.

11:25.393 --> 11:27.061
Just like when we first met.

11:29.188 --> 11:31.315
I recognized the girl
with the blue marks in her eyes.

11:35.945 --> 11:36.779
I recognized you.

11:54.380 --> 11:58.175
Do you think Bu-yeon
is with Jang Uk right now?

11:59.718 --> 12:01.762
Jang Uk will have gone to find her

12:01.846 --> 12:03.764
because of what she said
at the Unanimous Assembly.

12:03.848 --> 12:06.058
Why did you not stop her?

12:06.142 --> 12:08.185
Jang Uk got rid of Jin Mu,

12:08.853 --> 12:10.396
and Bu-yeon found the Jinyowon Plaque.

12:11.730 --> 12:12.982
Regardless of anything,

12:14.108 --> 12:16.569
the truth is that
they both protected Jinyowon.

12:18.571 --> 12:22.366
I would like to think that
she is looking out for the two of them.

12:22.450 --> 12:23.617
"She"?

12:24.785 --> 12:27.746
I asked them
how they first met each other here.

12:27.830 --> 12:31.375
They said someone had
opened the door to this place.

12:31.459 --> 12:33.377
Do you really believe

12:33.461 --> 12:36.255
that her soul remained in Jinyowon
along with the ice stone

12:36.338 --> 12:38.174
and was reborn as my daughter?

12:38.924 --> 12:40.342
How is that even possible?

12:40.426 --> 12:43.971
My existence is proof that it is possible.

12:48.058 --> 12:50.644
I am alive because I entered
the dead body of a young boy.

12:54.523 --> 12:56.025
She may have done the same.

12:56.108 --> 12:59.111
Let us say you are right
and that it is possible.

12:59.945 --> 13:03.991
What could be the reason
that she chose to stay?

13:04.074 --> 13:05.576
I am sure there is a good reason

13:06.327 --> 13:10.331
why she chose to stay with the ice stone
instead of leaving 200 years ago.

13:11.957 --> 13:14.460
It sounds like you know
what that reason may be.

13:15.544 --> 13:20.007
She must have protected the ice stone
because it was going to be used one day.

13:22.468 --> 13:26.931
Jin Seol-ran and my master, Seo Gyeong,
went through the Great Chaos,

13:27.515 --> 13:32.061
and I fear that the same kind of chaos
may occur once again.

13:34.104 --> 13:35.397
The fire bird is safe.

13:37.525 --> 13:38.901
Jin Mu is dead.

14:12.268 --> 14:14.311
Heo Yeom stocked this place
with food and firewood

14:14.395 --> 14:16.939
knowing I would come back here one day.

14:17.898 --> 14:19.650
It will be enough to last you a month.

14:20.609 --> 14:21.443
A month?

14:21.527 --> 14:23.404
What is the matter? Is it too short?

14:26.282 --> 14:28.576
I did not come
hoping to spend a lifetime together.

14:28.659 --> 14:32.413
I just came to stay by her side
until the very last moment.

14:32.496 --> 14:35.833
That could last a month, two weeks,

14:35.916 --> 14:38.210
or even just a few days.

14:40.671 --> 14:42.131
But I decided not to keep count.

14:43.549 --> 14:44.842
I am going to believe

14:46.010 --> 14:47.553
that we will always have tomorrow.

14:48.470 --> 14:52.141
How many of Naksu's memories
have returned?

14:53.976 --> 14:54.810
There is still

14:56.186 --> 14:58.147
a memory she does not recall.

14:59.231 --> 15:00.733
You said you were dying to know

15:01.525 --> 15:03.652
how I felt at that last moment with you.

15:08.574 --> 15:09.617
That moment will probably be

15:10.492 --> 15:12.411
the very last memory
that comes back to me.

15:19.835 --> 15:21.420
When I recall that last memory…

15:24.924 --> 15:26.425
I will give you a sign like this.

15:28.969 --> 15:32.306
Then I will tell you what I remember.

15:35.768 --> 15:36.810
It will be…

15:40.522 --> 15:42.066
my last love letter to you.

15:47.780 --> 15:49.907
In the past, I could not understand

15:49.990 --> 15:52.201
why Master Seo Gyeong
kept his love letter unsent

15:52.826 --> 15:54.453
despite having written it.

15:54.536 --> 15:59.083
But now I understand why he would
have been unable to send that letter.

15:59.166 --> 16:01.919
That love letter was for Jin Seol-ran.

16:03.754 --> 16:08.050
I hope the love you have for each other
will somehow reach her as well.

16:12.221 --> 16:14.932
Heo Yeom also got me new bedding.

16:15.015 --> 16:16.684
Maybe it is in storage.

16:20.270 --> 16:21.313
Jin Seol-ran?

16:47.256 --> 16:49.508
What is this barrier? Did you create it?

17:10.779 --> 17:11.780
That is the fire bird.

17:24.376 --> 17:26.712
The fire bird will dry out the world.

17:27.921 --> 17:30.466
I hoped that something so tragic
would never happen.

17:31.550 --> 17:35.012
But the foolish greed of humans
will lead the world to burn to ashes.

17:35.763 --> 17:36.680
The fire bird

17:38.057 --> 17:39.141
is going to escape?

17:39.224 --> 17:41.393
I just showed you

17:41.977 --> 17:44.104
what is going to happen to this world.

17:45.272 --> 17:48.859
I foresaw this happening
a very long time ago.

17:48.942 --> 17:50.861
You are able to see the future?

17:52.029 --> 17:52.988
Who are you?

17:53.655 --> 17:54.490
A priestess?

17:55.491 --> 17:57.493
You used the yin-and-yang jade
to summon me, right?

17:58.077 --> 18:01.413
I could not leave, for I was scared
that the world would fall into ruin.

18:02.247 --> 18:04.833
But I only ended up contributing
to the summoning of the fire bird

18:04.917 --> 18:06.293
and making this world burn.

18:07.544 --> 18:09.963
I am not capable
of stopping what will happen.

18:11.048 --> 18:12.800
It can only be stopped by the man

18:12.883 --> 18:16.011
who was born against the laws of nature
under the King's Star.

18:19.473 --> 18:23.727
I have been hiding under the shadow
that was created by your light.

18:25.395 --> 18:28.148
Now I plan to cast that shadow aside
and step out into the world.

18:28.232 --> 18:29.650
Cast the shadow aside

18:30.943 --> 18:32.069
and step out into the world?

18:34.446 --> 18:35.364
Does that mean

18:36.740 --> 18:37.991
you are Jin Bu-yeon?

18:40.661 --> 18:41.662
That is right.

18:42.746 --> 18:45.040
That is the name I was given
when I was reborn.

18:47.042 --> 18:49.962
Jin Bu-yeon attracted your shadow,

18:51.255 --> 18:52.297
used it,

18:54.049 --> 18:55.342
and will make it disappear.

18:56.051 --> 18:59.221
The world I foresaw
will come no matter what.

18:59.304 --> 19:00.139
And when it does,

19:01.390 --> 19:03.725
tragic events will occur.

19:13.318 --> 19:17.823
Just as Jin Seol-ran helped Seo Gyeong
stop the Great Chaos a long time ago,

19:18.699 --> 19:21.535
you are the only person
who can stop the fire bird,

19:22.619 --> 19:26.874
and Jin Bu-yeon must come into this world
to help you achieve that.

19:59.615 --> 20:02.576
Jin Bu-yeon attracted your shadow,

20:03.827 --> 20:04.828
used it,

20:05.579 --> 20:07.080
and will make it disappear.

20:08.373 --> 20:09.249
Did you meet…

20:11.877 --> 20:12.711
Jin Bu-yeon?

20:19.218 --> 20:20.219
Yes.

20:25.349 --> 20:27.017
I ended up seeing something

20:31.355 --> 20:32.231
that is inevitable.

20:36.944 --> 20:39.029
According to Jin Mu's plan,

20:39.112 --> 20:41.323
we must first take the fire bird
out of Jinyowon.

20:41.406 --> 20:44.117
Then we must confiscate
the Jinyowon Plaque

20:44.201 --> 20:46.119
by gathering another Unanimous Assembly.

20:46.203 --> 20:48.247
We need to keep Songrim out of it,

20:48.330 --> 20:49.915
but how will we justify it?

20:49.998 --> 20:52.376
We must use Jang Uk as our justification.

20:53.168 --> 20:55.671
He disobeyed the King's command,
did he not?

20:56.380 --> 20:57.214
That is right.

20:58.590 --> 21:00.717
When should we gather
the Unanimous Assembly?

21:01.593 --> 21:03.178
Are you all right?

21:28.620 --> 21:31.540
Forget about the Unanimous Assembly
and the Jinyowon Plaque.

21:31.623 --> 21:33.208
We have no time to waste.

21:33.834 --> 21:36.628
We must go to Jinyowon at once
and bring out the fire bird.

21:36.712 --> 21:37.796
We must do it now!

21:40.674 --> 21:43.760
Why did His Majesty gather the mages
of the Unanimous Assembly at this hour?

21:43.844 --> 21:45.304
I do not know why,

21:45.971 --> 21:48.181
but I think one of the mages
is a soul shifter.

21:48.932 --> 21:51.268
He absorbed the energy
of one of the eunuchs.

21:53.228 --> 21:54.771
A soul shifter is in the palace?

21:55.564 --> 21:56.982
Then His Majesty is in danger.

21:57.065 --> 21:59.151
- We must stop him.
- It is hard to believe,

21:59.234 --> 22:00.569
but I think that soul shifter

22:01.653 --> 22:03.113
is someone you know, Your Royal Highness.

22:03.196 --> 22:04.197
Someone I know?

22:06.366 --> 22:07.451
Who?

22:08.452 --> 22:09.703
It is me, Your Royal Highness.

22:16.877 --> 22:19.838
You are the Queen's relative
from Seoho Fortress, are you not?

22:19.921 --> 22:22.215
I see you fail to recognize me
because my appearance has changed.

22:22.299 --> 22:23.342
It is me.

22:23.425 --> 22:25.594
Your long-time master

22:25.677 --> 22:26.970
and Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,

22:27.763 --> 22:28.680
Jin Mu.

22:29.598 --> 22:30.432
Jin Mu?

22:34.227 --> 22:35.437
How can you be Jin Mu?

22:35.520 --> 22:37.397
I shifted into another body
when I was in Gwido.

22:38.231 --> 22:39.608
You shifted your soul?

22:39.691 --> 22:42.569
His Majesty sent someone for me,
so I was able to live.

22:42.652 --> 22:44.071
His Majesty saved you?

22:44.154 --> 22:46.782
I came back to help the King
and the Unanimous Assembly

22:46.865 --> 22:48.200
achieve their goal.

22:48.283 --> 22:49.117
Shut your mouth!

22:49.743 --> 22:51.369
His Majesty would never
see eye to eye with you.

22:51.453 --> 22:53.080
Jin Mu is telling the truth.

23:00.087 --> 23:02.214
Jin Mu will be standing with me
and the Unanimous Assembly.

23:02.798 --> 23:03.632
Your Majesty.

23:03.715 --> 23:05.592
Jin Mu, did you say you wish to take away

23:05.675 --> 23:07.594
the Crown Prince's Gold Plaque?

23:09.513 --> 23:10.514
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:13.683 --> 23:15.936
His Royal Highness stabbed me in the back,

23:17.020 --> 23:18.522
so I should return the favor.

23:20.941 --> 23:22.818
I shall take away
the Crown Prince's Gold Plaque.

23:24.069 --> 23:27.572
You are no longer the heir to the throne.

23:33.662 --> 23:36.206
Keep him locked up in here
until I say otherwise.

23:36.790 --> 23:37.666
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:38.667 --> 23:41.795
Your Majesty, you are being fooled by him.

23:43.964 --> 23:45.215
Your Majesty!

24:01.523 --> 24:02.357
Jin Mu.

24:04.526 --> 24:08.113
What are you trying to do by fooling
the King and Unanimous Assembly?

24:08.196 --> 24:10.448
I am merely picking up where I left off.

24:13.994 --> 24:16.496
I shall head to Jinyowon
and bring out the fire bird.

24:40.687 --> 24:41.646
Is Young Lady Bu-yeon

24:42.397 --> 24:43.773
also not here?

24:45.233 --> 24:47.277
Is she with Young Master Jang?

24:48.778 --> 24:49.779
Lady Jin.

24:50.989 --> 24:53.033
What is going on between them?

24:54.743 --> 24:56.995
I cannot tell you anything right now.

24:57.704 --> 24:59.915
Time will solve everything,

24:59.998 --> 25:01.583
so please have patience and wait.

25:02.167 --> 25:05.295
Does that mean you know where they are?

25:09.007 --> 25:09.841
Maidservant Kim.

25:10.425 --> 25:13.053
My mother still has not fully recovered

25:13.136 --> 25:14.930
after helping Young Master Seo.

25:16.056 --> 25:18.433
She needs to rest, so please go back home.

25:21.811 --> 25:24.856
Lady Jin, the mages
of the Unanimous Assembly are here.

25:25.565 --> 25:26.399
What?

25:34.115 --> 25:35.700
What do you think you are doing?

25:35.784 --> 25:38.620
How dare you attempt to enter Jinyowon
without my permission!

25:39.871 --> 25:41.873
Apologies, Lady Jin.

25:41.957 --> 25:46.461
We need to take out the artifact
that is needed for the lake's rite.

25:47.128 --> 25:48.338
Open the door to Jinyowon.

25:48.421 --> 25:51.216
You came barging in here
at this late hour to get the artifact

25:51.299 --> 25:52.676
for the lake's rite?

25:52.759 --> 25:54.386
The royal family has approved it,

25:55.178 --> 25:57.138
so all you need to do is open that door.

25:57.222 --> 25:58.306
I cannot do that.

25:58.848 --> 26:01.226
I cannot open that door
even if the royal family orders it.

26:01.977 --> 26:05.188
Have you forgotten
about the Jinyowon Plaque?

26:05.272 --> 26:09.651
All the mages of the Unanimous Assembly
are here except for Songrim,

26:10.318 --> 26:12.070
so we shall confiscate the plaque.

26:12.946 --> 26:14.489
Give us the plaque.

26:14.572 --> 26:16.574
This is ridiculous.

26:16.658 --> 26:17.951
I cannot let you do that.

26:18.034 --> 26:19.369
Enough!

26:23.790 --> 26:25.333
I told you we have no time.

26:38.638 --> 26:41.349
- Mother!
- Make one more step and your mother dies.

26:43.184 --> 26:44.311
Ho-gyeong.

26:45.603 --> 26:47.230
Your brother has shifted souls.

26:48.148 --> 26:52.485
Open that door before I suck out
all the energy of the Jin family

26:52.569 --> 26:53.737
that you are so proud of.

26:55.697 --> 26:56.740
Jin Cho-yeon!

26:59.117 --> 27:00.035
Open that door.

27:00.827 --> 27:04.164
Or I will drain your mother's energy
until she is as dry as firewood.

27:05.498 --> 27:06.374
Mother…

27:10.045 --> 27:11.379
Open the door.

27:11.463 --> 27:12.464
Do it now!

27:15.842 --> 27:17.135
He is a soul shifter.

27:17.218 --> 27:19.220
If he drains Lady Jin's energy,
she will die!

27:19.304 --> 27:20.430
Hurry and open the door!

27:58.635 --> 28:01.054
Quickly go to Songrim
and ask them for help.

28:01.888 --> 28:02.931
Hurry.

28:06.768 --> 28:07.769
Mother!

28:57.402 --> 29:00.488
Mother, are you all right?

29:06.453 --> 29:08.246
Is that the fire bird's egg?

29:12.083 --> 29:14.169
- What is that sound?
- What is that?

29:14.252 --> 29:17.213
Jinyowon must be collapsing
now that the fire bird's egg is out.

29:17.922 --> 29:19.758
We must leave now.

29:29.642 --> 29:30.643
Ho-gyeong.

29:32.479 --> 29:35.857
I could have absorbed all your energy,
but I could not bear to.

29:36.441 --> 29:39.235
Anything that belongs to Jinyowon
makes me sick to my stomach.

29:44.991 --> 29:46.075
Mother.

29:46.659 --> 29:47.619
Your wound is deep.

29:49.662 --> 29:51.664
We cannot let them take the fire bird.

29:52.290 --> 29:55.168
Go to Songrim right now
and ask them for help.

29:57.921 --> 29:59.547
Jin Cho-yeon! Go now!

29:59.631 --> 30:00.465
Hurry!

30:02.383 --> 30:03.218
Yes, Mother.

30:22.612 --> 30:23.655
Jinyowon…

30:24.489 --> 30:25.740
is collapsing.

30:37.085 --> 30:37.919
No.

30:38.545 --> 30:39.546
No…

30:47.178 --> 30:48.012
Lady Jin.

30:49.639 --> 30:52.058
Lady Jin, are you all right?

30:52.141 --> 30:55.395
Please take me inside Jinyowon.

30:55.478 --> 30:57.313
If Jinyowon collapses,

30:57.397 --> 31:00.900
all the relics inside will escape.

31:01.860 --> 31:04.863
I must use my divine powers
to keep them there.

31:13.496 --> 31:14.414
Hold onto me.

31:15.957 --> 31:17.250
I will take you inside.

31:36.769 --> 31:37.896
My lord.

31:39.230 --> 31:40.732
- Young Master Park.
- Are you all right?

31:40.815 --> 31:43.401
The mages of the Unanimous Assembly
took the fire bird.

31:44.444 --> 31:45.695
Jinyowon is going to collapse.

31:49.574 --> 31:51.743
I will check on Jinyowon.

31:52.577 --> 31:54.662
Go and follow the mages
who took the fire bird.

31:55.413 --> 31:57.707
- Yes, my lord.
- The fire bird is a dangerous relic,

31:57.790 --> 31:59.334
so I shall go with Young Master Park.

31:59.417 --> 32:01.461
My mother is severely injured.

32:02.086 --> 32:04.088
Please help her, Lord Park.

32:04.881 --> 32:05.715
All right.

32:12.305 --> 32:13.181
Uncle.

32:28.488 --> 32:29.697
Where is Lady Jin?

32:30.531 --> 32:32.450
She went inside
to keep the relics from escaping.

32:32.533 --> 32:35.036
Maidservant Kim went in there with her.

32:35.119 --> 32:36.329
Maidservant Kim?

32:38.414 --> 32:40.375
Maidservant Kim is inside Jinyowon?

32:48.841 --> 32:50.051
Maidservant Kim!

32:50.134 --> 32:52.512
Maidservant Kim, are you in there?

32:53.888 --> 32:55.848
Lord Park, I am in here!

33:03.731 --> 33:04.941
The relics are escaping!

33:05.733 --> 33:06.734
If it collapses,

33:06.818 --> 33:09.362
all the other dangerous relics
will escape as well!

33:11.364 --> 33:12.532
I must seal the door.

33:13.408 --> 33:15.201
Maidservant Kim, hurry up and leave.

33:15.284 --> 33:16.577
If you do not, you will die.

33:16.661 --> 33:17.620
What?

33:18.246 --> 33:21.749
The relics are starting to escape.

33:21.833 --> 33:23.376
I must seal the door!

33:25.336 --> 33:26.170
What about you?

33:31.300 --> 33:32.635
Maidservant Kim!

33:39.642 --> 33:41.185
It is going to collapse soon!

33:42.186 --> 33:45.189
If we do not seal the door,
we will not be able to stop the relics!

33:45.273 --> 33:46.107
No!

33:46.649 --> 33:49.235
I cannot seal the door.
Maidservant Kim is still…

33:52.196 --> 33:55.366
My wife is still in there.

33:59.996 --> 34:01.080
My lord!

34:01.748 --> 34:02.582
Seal…

34:03.583 --> 34:04.792
the door.

34:18.723 --> 34:20.475
Maidservant Kim!

34:23.853 --> 34:26.105
We cannot let this place collapse.

34:27.273 --> 34:28.107
So please…

34:29.901 --> 34:30.735
seal the door.

34:36.783 --> 34:38.451
I understand.

34:40.620 --> 34:41.496
My lord.

34:42.497 --> 34:43.664
I will be all right.

34:45.792 --> 34:47.460
So seal the door.

34:49.087 --> 34:50.254
Hurry!

34:51.297 --> 34:53.591
My lord! It is about to collapse!

35:27.291 --> 35:29.710
Even if you decide to seal that door,

35:30.545 --> 35:34.048
I know how heartbreaking
it will be for you,

35:34.632 --> 35:36.300
so it does not upset me so much.

36:42.867 --> 36:44.285
I do not mind it.

36:45.786 --> 36:48.789
Yeon…

36:51.375 --> 36:55.379
Yeon…

37:27.078 --> 37:28.537
Lord Park Jin.

37:29.330 --> 37:30.623
Do not fall into despair.

37:31.499 --> 37:34.001
You still have a chance to save her.

37:35.336 --> 37:38.839
I will give you the power
to save the person you love.

38:03.864 --> 38:04.865
Your Majesty…

38:06.158 --> 38:07.535
is this what you

38:08.911 --> 38:11.080
and the Unanimous Assembly both want?

38:11.163 --> 38:12.456
I told you.

38:13.249 --> 38:15.543
Everyone wants to share
the power of the ice stone.

38:15.626 --> 38:18.296
It would be greedy of Songrim
to keep it for themselves.

38:18.379 --> 38:22.466
The power should be divided
among the powerful mage families of Daeho

38:22.550 --> 38:25.845
and used wisely through common consent.

38:25.928 --> 38:27.305
So you plan to awaken

38:28.806 --> 38:33.227
the dangerous fire bird
just to achieve that?

38:33.311 --> 38:35.646
The lake's rite will bring us rain

38:35.730 --> 38:37.315
and help us get the ice stone.

38:38.649 --> 38:40.026
Then we will seal it back.

38:40.109 --> 38:44.071
What about the world
that will burn to ashes because of it?

38:44.697 --> 38:46.657
Does that not matter to you?

38:47.950 --> 38:50.369
All things require sacrifice.

38:51.370 --> 38:52.997
Worrying about insignificant things

38:53.080 --> 38:55.333
only prevents us
from achieving what we want.

38:55.958 --> 38:57.376
Do you not wish

38:58.252 --> 38:59.462
to save Maidservant Kim?

39:00.963 --> 39:03.382
Do not be a hypocrite
and pretend that is not what you want.

39:10.097 --> 39:10.973
Evil…

39:12.475 --> 39:15.895
always does what it wants
without ever stopping.

39:17.646 --> 39:18.939
But why is it that virtue

39:20.232 --> 39:24.320
always needs to prove itself
over and over again?

39:27.948 --> 39:28.783
Yes.

39:29.700 --> 39:30.951
I do wish to save her.

39:32.828 --> 39:36.123
I would do anything to save her,
even if it meant

39:37.416 --> 39:38.459
I would lose my sanity.

39:40.711 --> 39:41.796
But even so,

39:43.422 --> 39:44.256
I will…

39:47.051 --> 39:49.887
stop you from getting what you want.

39:52.139 --> 39:53.891
Not a single one of you

39:55.142 --> 39:57.436
has the right to laugh at me…

40:00.856 --> 40:02.233
and call me…

40:06.112 --> 40:07.154
a hypocrite.

40:42.106 --> 40:43.399
Stop right now…

40:47.778 --> 40:50.322
or I will break the barrier
of the fire bird.

42:07.149 --> 42:09.693
This place is going to burn down.

42:10.402 --> 42:11.570
We need to leave.

42:21.914 --> 42:23.832
He fought against
the representatives of eight families

42:23.916 --> 42:25.084
and still made it this far.

42:25.751 --> 42:27.795
He really was a highly skilled mage.

42:28.420 --> 42:29.255
What a waste.

42:29.338 --> 42:33.133
If he held hands with us,
I would have helped him shift souls.

42:33.217 --> 42:35.177
But he willingly chose death,

42:35.261 --> 42:36.845
so there is nothing we can do.

43:56.175 --> 43:57.676
Lord Park!

43:59.887 --> 44:02.640
- Lord Park!
- Lord Park!

44:04.850 --> 44:07.227
- Lady Jin!
- Lord Park!

44:09.146 --> 44:12.441
Lord Park!

44:20.824 --> 44:21.659
Uk.

44:22.701 --> 44:23.702
Uk…

44:23.786 --> 44:25.871
Uk, Jin is…

44:25.954 --> 44:27.289
Jin is…

44:29.375 --> 44:32.586
- Lady Jin!
- Lord Park!

45:14.086 --> 45:15.129
Last night,

45:16.338 --> 45:18.132
the fire bird was taken from Jinyowon.

45:18.757 --> 45:21.260
Lady Jin and Maidservant Kim
went inside Jinyowon

45:21.343 --> 45:23.637
in an attempt
to stop the relics from escaping…

45:26.056 --> 45:27.141
and passed away.

45:27.224 --> 45:31.478
Not even Jin Cho-yeon could open
the collapsed door to Jinyowon

45:32.396 --> 45:34.106
so we could not collect their bodies.

45:34.189 --> 45:35.232
Because of that…

45:36.817 --> 45:38.277
their coffins are empty.

45:38.944 --> 45:42.573
As for Lord Park, he tried to stop them
from breaking the fire bird's barrier,

45:44.074 --> 45:45.742
but the fire bird's energy
set the place on fire,

45:46.743 --> 45:47.911
and he passed away there.

45:49.288 --> 45:50.789
The place completely burned down.

45:51.498 --> 45:53.542
The only thing
we found there was his sword.

45:53.625 --> 45:56.336
I was locked up
after they took away my Gold Plaque.

45:58.005 --> 45:59.631
I narrowly escaped
when the fire broke out.

46:00.299 --> 46:02.259
My father, the King of this country,

46:03.969 --> 46:05.387
is with the Unanimous Assembly.

46:05.971 --> 46:06.889
This all happened

46:08.515 --> 46:11.894
because Jin Mu was able
to shift his soul into Seo Yun-o's body.

46:12.519 --> 46:15.022
I would barge into Cheonbugwan
right this instant,

46:16.482 --> 46:18.317
but they have the fire bird.

46:20.611 --> 46:22.571
We cannot make rash decisions.

46:22.654 --> 46:25.157
If people find out
that the fire bird got out,

46:25.240 --> 46:26.575
there will be extreme chaos.

46:26.658 --> 46:28.994
Let us quietly hold their funerals.

46:29.077 --> 46:31.330
Then we must stop them
from waking the fire bird.

46:32.706 --> 46:33.916
The fire bird will awaken.

46:37.002 --> 46:37.836
I was told that

46:38.754 --> 46:40.464
it is going to happen no matter what.

46:42.633 --> 46:43.592
However…

46:46.803 --> 46:48.222
these three did not pass away.

46:53.101 --> 46:55.812
If the disaster created
by human greed was foreseen,

46:55.896 --> 46:58.732
the will to stop it can become a variable…

47:00.943 --> 47:02.528
and change the outcome.

47:20.546 --> 47:22.297
Jin will be all right.

47:24.341 --> 47:25.467
Do not cry too much.

47:26.051 --> 47:26.885
All right.

47:41.316 --> 47:44.319
Lady Jin, you have used up
too much of your energy.

47:46.738 --> 47:48.240
Not only did they take the fire bird,

47:49.908 --> 47:52.286
but I also failed to stop all the relics…

47:54.204 --> 47:55.581
from escaping Jinyowon.

47:55.664 --> 47:58.584
You put your life at risk
and did your best.

48:01.336 --> 48:03.505
Was it Bu-yeon who entered Jinyowon…

48:05.090 --> 48:06.216
while it was collapsing?

48:06.300 --> 48:07.301
Yes.

48:08.176 --> 48:10.721
Jinyowon's door was built
by Jin Seol-ran as well.

48:11.805 --> 48:16.059
Bu-yeon created a door that allowed her
to enter Jinyowon from Danhyanggok.

48:23.692 --> 48:27.988
While she entered Jinyowon
and stopped it from collapsing,

48:28.572 --> 48:32.367
I followed her instructions
and went to find the fire bird.

48:35.412 --> 48:36.997
I could not find the fire bird.

48:38.373 --> 48:40.208
But fortunately, I was able to save Jin.

48:41.960 --> 48:45.088
Does that mean Naksu no longer lives

48:46.590 --> 48:48.133
in that body?

48:48.216 --> 48:49.468
She left the body,

48:50.594 --> 48:53.513
which led Bu-yeon
to completely regain her divine powers.

49:01.563 --> 49:03.357
It took you so long
to find each other again.

49:05.359 --> 49:07.819
But you were not even given
a full day together.

49:31.259 --> 49:32.552
The yin-and-yang jade

49:33.553 --> 49:35.722
is shared by couples
in order to stay together.

49:36.306 --> 49:37.307
So we can no longer…

49:40.644 --> 49:42.521
be sharing this.

50:12.175 --> 50:13.677
When I recall that last memory…

50:15.846 --> 50:17.347
I will give you a sign like this.

50:25.731 --> 50:26.857
I guess we were…

50:29.484 --> 50:31.570
never fated to recognize each other
at first sight.

50:33.113 --> 50:35.282
My birth led to your father's death.

50:37.075 --> 50:38.702
Then you killed me to avenge him.

50:40.120 --> 50:40.954
You are right.

50:42.038 --> 50:43.874
Judging by the fate that we share…

50:45.792 --> 50:47.335
we probably should not have met.

50:48.253 --> 50:49.171
But…

50:51.089 --> 50:52.466
fate was not what brought us…

50:53.759 --> 50:55.552
to recognize each other at first sight.

50:57.053 --> 50:57.888
We…

50:59.014 --> 51:02.601
lightened up each other's lives
when we needed each other the most.

51:03.310 --> 51:05.228
We embraced the shadows that came with it…

51:07.022 --> 51:08.774
and chose to love each other.

51:10.776 --> 51:11.693
So now…

51:14.029 --> 51:15.405
there is only one reply I can give you

51:18.450 --> 51:20.869
in our last moment together.

51:30.462 --> 51:31.421
I love you.

52:51.710 --> 52:54.087
Songrim is mourning,
and the fire bird is in our hands.

52:54.170 --> 52:56.965
Neither Jang Uk nor Songrim
will be able to do anything now.

52:57.674 --> 53:00.969
Tonight, I will wake the fire bird
and perform the lake's rite.

53:01.052 --> 53:04.264
Then after tonight, I will be able to use
the power of the ice stone

53:04.347 --> 53:06.975
and finally abandon this weak, ill body.

53:08.602 --> 53:11.771
People could show up to hinder our plan,

53:11.855 --> 53:14.024
so please gather all the guards
protecting Daeho Fortress

53:14.107 --> 53:15.650
and have them protect Cheonbugwan.

53:15.734 --> 53:18.612
I will send my army to Cheonbugwan.

53:18.695 --> 53:20.572
I want you to safely awaken the fire bird

53:21.156 --> 53:22.991
and bring me the ice stone.

53:28.997 --> 53:30.373
Your Royal Highness,

53:30.457 --> 53:32.876
please stop the King
from mobilizing his army.

53:35.378 --> 53:39.633
But I no longer have the Gold Plaque
that gives me power over the army.

53:45.931 --> 53:46.806
Use this.

53:48.683 --> 53:50.518
This was left for you by the late king.

53:51.853 --> 53:53.480
This country does not need a king

53:53.563 --> 53:57.025
who does not care
whether or not the world burns to ashes.

53:58.735 --> 54:00.612
It needs a king who wishes to stop it.

54:10.538 --> 54:12.499
I already stole your King's Star.

54:12.582 --> 54:15.043
Now I will even be using your Gold Plaque.

54:15.835 --> 54:16.670
Jang Uk.

54:19.673 --> 54:22.884
Have you really never dreamed of
becoming the most powerful person

54:23.927 --> 54:24.761
in this world?

54:27.263 --> 54:28.890
I have already climbed

54:30.016 --> 54:32.852
to the very peak of this world
with the person…

54:34.187 --> 54:35.355
I made that promise with.

54:37.565 --> 54:38.483
That is…

54:41.695 --> 54:42.821
more than enough for me.

54:56.751 --> 54:58.795
While we perform the lake's rite,

54:58.878 --> 55:02.465
the King will send his army
to Cheonbugwan and protect it.

55:02.549 --> 55:04.509
Jang Uk and Songrim might come to stop us.

55:05.760 --> 55:07.762
What are you worried about?
We have the fire bird.

55:07.846 --> 55:09.055
You saw Park Jin.

55:09.639 --> 55:12.350
He could not do anything
despite his strength and power.

55:12.434 --> 55:15.270
I guess you are right.
Once we break the fire bird's barrier,

55:15.353 --> 55:17.772
Jang Uk and Songrim will become helpless.

55:17.856 --> 55:19.566
Awakening the fire bird is dangerous.

55:20.150 --> 55:23.278
If the flames burst toward us
while we break the barrier,

55:23.361 --> 55:25.864
we will instantly be reduced to ashes.

55:25.947 --> 55:28.283
If the fire bird fails to fly
after being disturbed

55:28.366 --> 55:30.326
and its energy of fire bursts…

55:32.954 --> 55:34.706
all of Daeho Fortress will burn.

55:35.290 --> 55:37.125
They will not be able to do anything…

55:40.628 --> 55:42.130
fearing that the fire bird might awaken.

55:49.345 --> 55:52.182
I am going to go to Cheonbugwan
and awaken the fire bird.

55:54.893 --> 55:57.896
You are going to awaken the fire bird,
not stop it from awakening?

55:57.979 --> 56:00.607
If the awakening
of the fire bird is inevitable,

56:00.690 --> 56:04.277
it is better to let it happen
while we still have control over it

56:04.360 --> 56:06.821
so we can change the outcome.

56:07.822 --> 56:09.240
At the place where the energy of the sky

56:09.324 --> 56:11.451
reached the ground
and created a huge form of energy,

56:11.534 --> 56:14.079
I will get rid of the fire bird
that is filled with the energy of fire.

56:14.162 --> 56:15.288
In order to do that,

56:16.372 --> 56:17.665
I must awaken the fire bird.

56:35.809 --> 56:38.103
I checked the energy of the sky
through the constellation basin.

56:38.186 --> 56:41.231
The energy of fire will be strongest
between 7 and 9 p.m. tonight.

56:41.314 --> 56:45.151
Once that time comes,
I shall begin the lake's rite.

56:55.495 --> 56:59.707
Cheonbugwan will begin performing
the rite between 7 and 9 p.m. tonight.

56:59.791 --> 57:00.667
During that time?

57:01.960 --> 57:05.839
Have the guards protecting Daeho Fortress
headed to Cheonbugwan?

57:05.922 --> 57:09.551
The leader of the guards
will be here soon to give you a report.

57:09.634 --> 57:10.468
Good.

57:44.252 --> 57:45.753
Is it not time yet?

57:45.837 --> 57:48.965
Why is the leader of the guards
not here to report yet?

57:49.048 --> 57:50.633
The guards will not be going anywhere.

57:59.851 --> 58:00.852
I…

58:02.145 --> 58:04.606
withdrew the order you gave, Your Majesty.

58:04.689 --> 58:06.107
What is that?

58:07.317 --> 58:08.651
Is that not a Gold Plaque?

58:11.362 --> 58:13.698
It is the Gold Plaque of the man
you have feared all your life.

58:14.824 --> 58:16.868
The man born under the King's Star.

58:19.537 --> 58:20.371
The King's Star?

58:20.455 --> 58:21.998
The man born under the King's Star

58:22.790 --> 58:25.126
will stop what is happening
at Cheonbugwan.

58:28.254 --> 58:29.088
Father.

58:31.716 --> 58:33.801
It is time you step down from the throne…

58:36.846 --> 58:38.515
that kept you anxious all your life.

58:43.853 --> 58:44.979
What…

59:55.550 --> 59:57.760
Relics that will ignite
the fire bird's energy

59:58.386 --> 59:59.971
are placed all over the canal.

01:00:00.555 --> 01:00:02.098
We must find and destroy them all.

01:00:02.181 --> 01:00:03.641
- Let us hurry.
- Yes, my lady.

01:00:13.568 --> 01:00:15.653
Songrim forces have entered Cheonbugwan.

01:00:16.279 --> 01:00:18.906
It is not time yet, but let us begin.

01:00:18.990 --> 01:00:20.074
It is dangerous to rush it.

01:00:20.158 --> 01:00:21.993
If the energy of fire explodes,
we will all die.

01:00:22.076 --> 01:00:23.995
If we lose the fire bird,
we will all be doomed.

01:00:24.078 --> 01:00:25.663
That is better than burning to death.

01:00:26.372 --> 01:00:27.457
Count me out.

01:00:38.217 --> 01:00:41.262
No one here has the right to stop this.
Otherwise, you will die.

01:00:43.514 --> 01:00:44.474
Now…

01:00:45.725 --> 01:00:47.560
I want all of you to wake the fire bird!

01:00:47.644 --> 01:00:49.228
Jin Mu is right.

01:00:49.312 --> 01:00:52.774
Let us wake the fire bird
so we can get the ice stone.

01:01:13.711 --> 01:01:16.756
You were supposed to be careful.
Why is it suddenly awakening?

01:01:31.270 --> 01:01:33.523
Jang Uk. What are you doing?

01:01:33.606 --> 01:01:35.608
I am helping you all awaken the fire bird.

01:01:47.161 --> 01:01:48.329
Jang Uk, stop!

01:01:48.996 --> 01:01:52.917
If the energy of fire explodes,
it will kill us all!

01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:57.171
Did you expect to live
while the world went up in flames?

01:02:00.216 --> 01:02:01.884
I am sorry, but I cannot allow that.

01:02:01.968 --> 01:02:02.802
Jang Uk.

01:02:03.469 --> 01:02:05.304
Do you plan to kill
everyone in the Unanimous Assembly?

01:02:06.764 --> 01:02:09.183
Is this not the kind of world you wanted?

01:02:09.892 --> 01:02:13.438
Take a close look at what it is like
for someone with strength

01:02:15.314 --> 01:02:16.858
to gain and wield even greater power.

01:02:36.252 --> 01:02:37.086
Jang Uk.

01:02:46.512 --> 01:02:48.055
You were right, Jang Uk.

01:02:49.432 --> 01:02:51.976
In a world where those with strength
gain greater power,

01:02:53.102 --> 01:02:55.730
the weak will just perish.

01:03:59.710 --> 01:04:03.130
Jin Bu-yeon safely arrived at Cheonbugwan.

01:04:03.881 --> 01:04:07.093
She and Yul are waiting for the fire bird
by the constellation basin.

01:04:08.427 --> 01:04:09.262
All right.

01:04:10.930 --> 01:04:12.807
Take this to Jin Bu-yeon and tell her

01:04:13.724 --> 01:04:17.103
that I will be waiting
at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:04:25.570 --> 01:04:28.739
I found Jang Uk's constellation plate
where the Crown Prince said it would be.

01:04:37.832 --> 01:04:39.417
Is the fire bird safe?

01:04:45.923 --> 01:04:48.467
Jin Bu-yeon has
regained all of her divine powers.

01:04:48.551 --> 01:04:49.927
And the fire bird is safe.

01:04:53.681 --> 01:04:55.391
She will awaken it
atop the constellation basin.

01:04:59.937 --> 01:05:02.398
We got rid of all the relics
that would prevent the fire bird

01:05:02.481 --> 01:05:03.691
from going to Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:05:21.918 --> 01:05:24.837
The star in the very center
of the Big Dipper is the King's Star.

01:05:29.008 --> 01:05:30.217
Now she will wake the fire bird

01:05:31.719 --> 01:05:33.137
and send it to the King's Star.

01:05:33.804 --> 01:05:34.847
I heard that

01:05:34.931 --> 01:05:38.809
the seven stars gather their energy
and send it to the King's Star.

01:05:38.893 --> 01:05:41.395
But right now, there are only six of us.

01:05:41.479 --> 01:05:44.106
No, there are seven.

01:05:45.149 --> 01:05:46.817
There is one more person…

01:05:49.695 --> 01:05:51.030
who was always beside Uk.

01:05:51.739 --> 01:05:52.782
Now she will wake the fire bird

01:05:54.450 --> 01:05:56.327
and send it to Uk
at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

01:06:46.544 --> 01:06:47.878
- How beautiful.
- What is that?

01:06:47.962 --> 01:06:50.006
- What is that?
- Do you know what that is?

01:06:50.589 --> 01:06:51.465
Look at that.

01:06:53.259 --> 01:06:55.177
The fire bird is awake.

01:09:12.189 --> 01:09:13.816
Jang Uk did it.

01:09:15.401 --> 01:09:16.235
The fire bird

01:09:17.570 --> 01:09:18.654
has disappeared.

01:09:34.753 --> 01:09:36.297
- Jin Bu-yeon.
- Shaman.

01:09:36.380 --> 01:09:37.339
Bu-yeon.

01:10:22.301 --> 01:10:24.053
To the light that has saved the world,

01:10:25.679 --> 01:10:28.265
I shall now return your shadow.

01:10:30.017 --> 01:10:32.061
A light that embraces a shadow

01:10:32.937 --> 01:10:36.023
will never be lost in darkness.

01:10:45.699 --> 01:10:47.660
1 YEAR LATER

01:10:47.743 --> 01:10:49.119
Peekaboo.

01:10:49.870 --> 01:10:51.247
How lovely.

01:10:52.206 --> 01:10:55.668
I cannot believe two of these
precious babies came out at once.

01:10:55.751 --> 01:10:57.086
Peekaboo.

01:10:57.169 --> 01:10:58.587
How lovely.

01:10:58.671 --> 01:10:59.880
Peekaboo.

01:10:59.964 --> 01:11:01.173
- How lovely.
- How lovely.

01:11:01.257 --> 01:11:04.385
What are Dan and Gang doing here again?

01:11:04.969 --> 01:11:05.928
Oh, dear.

01:11:06.637 --> 01:11:07.805
My goodness.

01:11:08.639 --> 01:11:09.598
There we go.

01:11:09.682 --> 01:11:12.101
Are you Gang or Dan?

01:11:12.184 --> 01:11:15.312
He came with his wife to leave them here
to visit his mother-in-law.

01:11:15.396 --> 01:11:17.690
They always ask you to babysit for them

01:11:18.482 --> 01:11:19.525
and go on dates.

01:11:20.442 --> 01:11:21.360
What about us?

01:11:21.443 --> 01:11:22.945
We are newlyweds too.

01:11:23.570 --> 01:11:26.573
This is why we are never able
to go on trips to places far away.

01:11:27.157 --> 01:11:28.826
Stop babysitting for them.

01:11:28.909 --> 01:11:31.662
If you keep doing this,
they will never stop asking.

01:11:32.246 --> 01:11:33.539
It is just for a while.

01:11:33.622 --> 01:11:36.500
What would you do
if they were Uk's babies?

01:11:39.962 --> 01:11:42.673
- Would you still not babysit them?
- Young Master Jang?

01:11:44.466 --> 01:11:47.386
I can babysit 12 babies
if it is for Young Master Jang.

01:11:47.469 --> 01:11:50.431
Your young master
still comes first, right?

01:11:50.514 --> 01:11:52.725
He will forever be your number one.

01:11:52.808 --> 01:11:54.768
Goodness, do not be jealous.

01:11:57.855 --> 01:11:59.148
What a relief.

01:11:59.231 --> 01:12:01.692
They are both handsome
because they take after Young Lady Jin.

01:12:01.775 --> 01:12:05.070
They have long arms and legs
because they take after Dang-gu.

01:12:05.154 --> 01:12:08.741
I know the babies are adorable
but do not babysit them all the time.

01:12:08.824 --> 01:12:09.950
Only once in a while.

01:12:12.411 --> 01:12:14.038
- Goodness.
- What is the matter?

01:12:14.621 --> 01:12:16.290
Maybe it is the honey biscuits
I ate earlier.

01:12:18.667 --> 01:12:19.793
Is it…

01:12:22.046 --> 01:12:25.174
- Is it what I think it is?
- No, it cannot be.

01:12:38.896 --> 01:12:40.856
Nothing is for sure yet.

01:12:45.527 --> 01:12:47.613
I have high expectations for you.

01:12:49.239 --> 01:12:51.700
Next time, I hope you have twin girls.

01:12:54.411 --> 01:12:58.707
Does that mean you are disappointed
that Gang and Dan are sons?

01:12:58.791 --> 01:13:01.126
I am not disappointed,
but they took their father's last name.

01:13:01.710 --> 01:13:04.296
I am merely asking for a daughter
who will carry on our family line.

01:13:05.214 --> 01:13:07.591
Uk told me not to dream
of having a daughter

01:13:07.674 --> 01:13:09.802
since they are planning
to give birth to one.

01:13:11.804 --> 01:13:14.098
Did you say they are at North Fortress?

01:13:14.181 --> 01:13:18.435
They caught one at North Fortress,
then headed straight to Seoho Fortress.

01:13:18.519 --> 01:13:20.354
But I do not know when they will return.

01:13:20.437 --> 01:13:23.190
They promised to return
to celebrate the twins' 100th day.

01:13:23.899 --> 01:13:24.733
Right.

01:13:24.817 --> 01:13:28.612
Bu-yeon agreed to help out at Jeongjingak,
so they might return sooner than planned.

01:13:28.695 --> 01:13:31.490
What do you mean,
Bu-yeon agreed to help out at Jeongjingak?

01:13:31.573 --> 01:13:34.284
Jeongjingak is recruiting new mages,

01:13:34.368 --> 01:13:36.787
and she promised Yul to interview them.

01:13:36.870 --> 01:13:40.332
Jeongjingak is recruiting mages
through interviews?

01:13:40.916 --> 01:13:42.793
Seo Yul is now in charge of Jeongjingak,

01:13:42.876 --> 01:13:44.753
which was established
by Master Seo Gyeong.

01:13:44.837 --> 01:13:47.506
He made that decision
as the new leader of Jeongjingak.

01:13:47.589 --> 01:13:48.882
QUALIFICATIONS
ANYONE WITH PASSION AND DETERMINATION

01:13:51.135 --> 01:13:55.222
Is this really how you plan to recruit
new mages for Jeongjingak?

01:13:55.305 --> 01:13:57.891
Then all sorts of people will apply.

01:13:57.975 --> 01:14:00.894
Word has spread that Seo Yul is in charge
of gathering pupils at Jeongjingak.

01:14:00.978 --> 01:14:03.772
All the mages' children in the capital
are very excited about it.

01:14:03.856 --> 01:14:06.733
However, if we recruit them this way,
children from prestigious families

01:14:06.817 --> 01:14:09.027
will most likely not apply out of pride.

01:14:09.111 --> 01:14:11.613
When Master Seo Gyeong built Jeongjingak,
he would have wanted more

01:14:12.197 --> 01:14:15.242
than for us to train children
from prestigious families.

01:14:15.826 --> 01:14:19.163
But not everyone
has the power to cast spells.

01:14:19.246 --> 01:14:21.039
I am not recruiting just anyone.

01:14:21.707 --> 01:14:24.293
I will pick people
with good energy and potential.

01:14:24.376 --> 01:14:28.839
And based on that,
those two were the ones that you picked?

01:14:35.846 --> 01:14:39.224
The most powerful priestess in Daeho
saw their energy and recommended them.

01:14:39.308 --> 01:14:42.352
She even told me that
if Sun-i is trained well,

01:14:42.436 --> 01:14:45.147
she could even outshine
her own husband, Jang Uk.

01:14:45.230 --> 01:14:47.608
She has the potential to outshine Jang Uk?

01:14:47.691 --> 01:14:49.735
They are my first pupils.

01:14:49.818 --> 01:14:53.238
I will train them rigorously
and make sure they outperform Uk.

01:15:00.329 --> 01:15:02.664
Seo Yul has always been
fixated on being the best,

01:15:02.748 --> 01:15:05.000
even when he used to train at Jeongjingak.

01:15:05.083 --> 01:15:09.838
Those two are going to have it tough
thanks to their persistent master.

01:15:09.922 --> 01:15:13.675
Anyway, what matters is that
Jin Bu-yeon vouched for them.

01:15:13.759 --> 01:15:15.427
So they must have something special.

01:15:15.511 --> 01:15:19.014
I heard that she also secretly takes part

01:15:19.097 --> 01:15:22.309
in interviewing potential wives
for His Majesty the King.

01:15:25.521 --> 01:15:26.480
She interviews them?

01:15:34.363 --> 01:15:35.572
Master Heo.

01:15:35.656 --> 01:15:37.699
Why are you staring at Young Lady Heo?

01:15:37.783 --> 01:15:41.662
I am trying to see
if she is fit to be a queen.

01:15:42.788 --> 01:15:43.622
A queen?

01:15:43.705 --> 01:15:47.751
A long time ago,
I gave Jang Uk my torrent of energy,

01:15:47.834 --> 01:15:52.297
and he promised
to grant me a wish in return.

01:15:52.381 --> 01:15:54.633
Married couples are one
both in body and spirit,

01:15:54.716 --> 01:15:57.177
so if the wife takes part
in choosing the queen,

01:15:57.261 --> 01:15:59.972
I can ask them to pick my granddaughter.

01:16:01.431 --> 01:16:04.393
But Master Heo. Young Lady Heo
is currently seeing someone.

01:16:05.352 --> 01:16:06.186
What?

01:16:07.062 --> 01:16:07.896
Who?

01:16:08.480 --> 01:16:10.357
A young man once came with a broken arm.

01:16:10.440 --> 01:16:12.651
Since then, he brings flowers for her
every time he visits.

01:16:14.611 --> 01:16:15.654
Is that so?

01:16:17.614 --> 01:16:19.449
- What kind of man is he?
- He is handsome.

01:16:19.533 --> 01:16:21.493
He is as handsome as Young Master Seo.

01:16:21.577 --> 01:16:22.411
Really?

01:16:23.537 --> 01:16:25.872
I had no idea Yun-ok was seeing someone.

01:16:26.915 --> 01:16:28.584
I am so proud of her.

01:16:28.667 --> 01:16:31.628
Then instead of asking her
to pick my granddaughter as queen,

01:16:31.712 --> 01:16:34.298
I shall ask her to interview that man.

01:16:34.381 --> 01:16:36.508
Picking a wife for His Majesty
is more urgent.

01:16:37.092 --> 01:16:39.428
He focuses only
on taking care of political affairs,

01:16:39.511 --> 01:16:41.513
and he frequently
invites Master Lee to the palace.

01:16:42.306 --> 01:16:43.599
Rumors say that His Majesty

01:16:43.682 --> 01:16:46.852
even may have
appointed Master Lee as his master.

01:16:46.935 --> 01:16:47.811
What?

01:16:48.645 --> 01:16:51.064
Does that mean he is practicing chastity?

01:16:51.648 --> 01:16:54.526
They say the King of Daeho
has cut off his libido.

01:16:54.610 --> 01:16:56.403
But then what about his successor?

01:16:56.486 --> 01:16:58.071
Did you not hear the rumor?

01:16:58.155 --> 01:17:00.073
Rumor has it that
the king before the last had a son.

01:17:00.741 --> 01:17:03.035
Yes, they say that his son is Jang Uk.

01:17:03.118 --> 01:17:06.496
No wonder Jang Uk
was always so extraordinary.

01:17:06.580 --> 01:17:10.125
The moment I saw him
beat the Crown Prince in a fight,

01:17:10.208 --> 01:17:12.377
I knew there was
something special about him.

01:17:12.461 --> 01:17:14.004
Should I also try practicing chastity?

01:17:14.087 --> 01:17:15.922
Cut the nonsense.

01:17:16.006 --> 01:17:17.549
Those men are unbelievable.

01:17:17.633 --> 01:17:19.760
His Majesty should quickly get married

01:17:19.843 --> 01:17:22.054
so that people stop saying
he cut off his libido.

01:17:22.137 --> 01:17:24.640
I cannot believe people think
that I, the King, cut off my libido.

01:17:26.725 --> 01:17:27.851
That is surely

01:17:28.477 --> 01:17:31.730
the most absurd thing I have heard
since a bogus shaman told me

01:17:31.813 --> 01:17:33.273
to adopt a turtle as my son.

01:17:34.358 --> 01:17:35.692
- I am the King.
- Exactly.

01:17:35.776 --> 01:17:38.403
That is why you should
quickly find yourself a wife.

01:17:38.487 --> 01:17:39.821
But Jin Bu-yeon promised

01:17:39.905 --> 01:17:43.325
to come back and send royal notices
to the women she already picked out.

01:17:43.408 --> 01:17:45.243
When will those two be back?

01:17:45.327 --> 01:17:49.206
What they are doing is also important,
and they still seem pretty busy.

01:17:49.790 --> 01:17:52.292
How many relics escaped Jinyowon
when it collapsed?

01:17:52.376 --> 01:17:53.960
A total of 31 escaped,

01:17:54.044 --> 01:17:56.254
and they have captured 12 as of now.

01:17:56.338 --> 01:18:00.217
Among those, there is a mouse
that goes around in human form,

01:18:00.300 --> 01:18:03.261
and a dangerous pipe that lures children.

01:18:03.345 --> 01:18:05.597
Amid them, a crock that spreads rumors
and causes strife,

01:18:05.681 --> 01:18:09.976
and a crying frog that spreads plagues
are especially dangerous.

01:18:10.060 --> 01:18:12.604
They will have to stay busy
in order to catch them all.

01:18:19.236 --> 01:18:20.445
Jang Uk will likely use that

01:18:20.529 --> 01:18:23.740
as an excuse to reject my every offer
to make him the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

01:18:24.783 --> 01:18:27.202
I will suggest it once again
the next time I meet him.

01:18:27.786 --> 01:18:29.705
I will tell him to drop by the palace

01:18:29.788 --> 01:18:32.249
since Your Majesty misses him dearly.

01:18:37.045 --> 01:18:38.797
This is the pottery that holds Gwiseo.

01:18:39.297 --> 01:18:42.467
Tell them to capture the mouse
and put it in here.

01:18:43.260 --> 01:18:44.094
All right.

01:18:44.678 --> 01:18:48.598
I am relieved that you stopped
many relics from escaping.

01:18:49.391 --> 01:18:51.601
If the swarm of mosquitoes
that causes earthquakes had escaped,

01:18:51.685 --> 01:18:53.061
it would have been very dangerous.

01:18:53.145 --> 01:18:56.440
I was able to live that day thanks to her.

01:18:57.274 --> 01:18:58.108
Do you

01:18:59.234 --> 01:19:01.361
no longer feel agony whenever you see her?

01:19:02.612 --> 01:19:04.156
Like you said,

01:19:04.239 --> 01:19:08.827
if it was really Jin Seol-ran's soul
that was born through Bu-yeon's body,

01:19:08.910 --> 01:19:11.079
and she chose that girl
to protect that body

01:19:11.163 --> 01:19:12.831
as she left this world,

01:19:14.291 --> 01:19:18.712
I choose to believe that
my daughter is living on thanks to her.

01:19:23.550 --> 01:19:27.429
This mouse eats the clippings
of someone who trims their nails at night

01:19:27.512 --> 01:19:29.806
and takes the appearance of that person.

01:19:30.974 --> 01:19:35.395
It transforms to look just like you,
then goes to your house

01:19:35.979 --> 01:19:38.315
and eats your parents alive!

01:19:42.819 --> 01:19:43.653
So…

01:19:44.946 --> 01:19:49.743
always be careful
where you throw away your nail clippings.

01:19:52.829 --> 01:19:56.082
If you are scared, you can go
and pray to the tree at Danhyanggok.

01:19:56.166 --> 01:19:59.419
There is a gigantic tree in Danhyanggok,

01:19:59.503 --> 01:20:03.632
and when there is a full moon,
two people appear on top of that tree.

01:20:03.715 --> 01:20:07.719
They saved my big sister
when she was being chased by a tiger.

01:20:08.303 --> 01:20:11.431
They also summoned fireflies
and lit up the dark path for her.

01:20:12.015 --> 01:20:14.017
- Really?
- Is that true?

01:20:14.100 --> 01:20:17.229
Do they show up there often?

01:20:17.312 --> 01:20:20.607
Yes, I heard the man is very tall
and the woman is very beautiful.

01:20:20.690 --> 01:20:23.318
They are a married couple.

01:20:23.401 --> 01:20:25.445
He is a bright light
that protects the world,

01:20:26.112 --> 01:20:29.950
and she is a shadow that protects him
by embracing the darkness surrounding him.

01:20:39.709 --> 01:20:40.794
Darling.

01:20:40.877 --> 01:20:43.922
How long are you going
to make me carry you up here?

01:20:44.005 --> 01:20:45.006
For eternity.

01:20:46.091 --> 01:20:47.801
- For eternity?
- You promised.

01:20:48.385 --> 01:20:49.219
Right.

01:20:50.053 --> 01:20:52.681
What is the matter?
Are you already tired of doing it?

01:20:52.764 --> 01:20:54.641
- No, of course not.
- Forget it. Let us go down.

01:20:54.724 --> 01:20:55.892
No, wait.

01:20:58.436 --> 01:21:01.273
It is not that I am tired of doing it.

01:21:01.356 --> 01:21:03.316
You were once a mage who mastered Chisu.

01:21:03.400 --> 01:21:06.695
So I am merely telling you
to challenge yourself.

01:21:06.778 --> 01:21:09.239
There is no need,
for I possess divine powers.

01:21:09.823 --> 01:21:11.116
You want me to train again?

01:21:12.033 --> 01:21:14.452
No way. Never.
I get sick just thinking about it.

01:21:14.536 --> 01:21:16.913
Gosh, back when you were my master,

01:21:16.997 --> 01:21:18.957
did you not always scold me
for being lazy?

01:21:19.040 --> 01:21:21.543
You were able to come this far
thanks to your great master.

01:21:21.626 --> 01:21:24.629
- What?
- Be grateful and treat her well.

01:21:25.422 --> 01:21:26.256
All right, fine.

01:21:27.215 --> 01:21:30.010
So did you find the creature
you were looking for?

01:21:30.677 --> 01:21:32.220
- Did you see it?
- Yes.

01:21:32.888 --> 01:21:33.722
I saw it.

01:21:35.849 --> 01:21:37.309
It is in the west of the forest.

01:21:44.816 --> 01:21:47.193
It is a cat, a wily beast
that escaped from Jinyowon.

01:21:47.861 --> 01:21:49.029
A cat?

01:21:54.576 --> 01:21:57.579
Hey, I thought you said it was a cat?

01:21:58.288 --> 01:22:01.625
That growl sounds like
it may be strong enough to eat a tiger.

01:22:02.292 --> 01:22:04.753
It is as big as an elephant.

01:22:04.836 --> 01:22:06.087
That is going to be

01:22:07.088 --> 01:22:08.673
one cute cat.

01:22:19.559 --> 01:22:20.727
Stay close to me.

01:22:29.152 --> 01:22:29.986
Here it comes.

01:22:31.738 --> 01:22:32.906
Go and take care of it.

